  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gtm Catering Services vs The Additional Chief Secretary on 18 November, 2025 Author: M.Dhandapani Bench: M.Dhandapani W In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 18-11-2025 Coram The Honourable Mr Justice M.Dhandapani Wp No. 19315 of 2024 Gtm Catering Services Represented By G.T.Manoharan, No 6, AR.A.Street, Muthalamman Kovil, West Karaikudi,Sivagangai District. P Vs 1.The Additional Chief Secretary Commissioner of Revenue, Administration & State Relief Commissionerate, Chepauk, Chennai - 600 005. 2.The Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, No.359, Anna Salai, Chennai 600 006. 3.The Designated Officer Food Safety and Drug Department Saidapet, Chennai 600 015. 4.The Dean Rajiv Gandhi",
    "facts": "Therefore, the petitioner had been serving food to the inpatients admitted in the Government Corona Hospital, Guindy from 14.09.2020 till 30.09.2021. The petitioner gave representation to the 5th respondent on 02.07.2021 for claiming the pending bill from 01.01.2021 to 30.06.2021. Thereafter, the respondents have paid the bill from March 2021 to September 2021, but till now the respondents have not paid the bill for the period from 01.01.2021 to 02.02.2021 to a tune of Rs.49,25,231/-.",
